<title>SINGAPORE: Guthrie unit to develop Singapore site.</title>
<headline>Guthrie unit to develop Singapore site.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guthrie GTS Ltd said in a statement on Thursday its 70 percent owned subsidiary, Guthrie Property Investments Pte Ltd, has acquired a 99-year leasehold land parcel from the Urban Redevelopment Authority.</p>
<p>Guthrie will undertake a residential/commercial development along with a 200-lot car park on the site.</p>
<p>The cost of the entire development, including the cost of the land, is estimated to be about Singapore $50 million, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore news room (65) 870-3080</p>
</text>
